# Cryptid Inspector manifested face down is a 2/2 with no abilities (CR 708.2a), so its own entering face down triggers nothing; turned face
# up (CR 701.40b) it is "this creature ... turned face up" and puts a +1/+1 counter on itself (a 3/4, not a 4/5).
#
# Turn 1: Black Lotus pays for Hauntwoods Shrieker. Turn 3 the Shrieker attacks and manifests the Inspector (Arrange puts it first) with
# Lightning Bolt into the graveyard; the three Moxen pay {2}{G} to turn it face up.

